1
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:41,000
Blood Red is a western film directed by Peter Masterson.

2
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:16,000
Set in the Napa Valley in 1895, an immigrant family struggles
to keep their vineyards from industrialists.

3
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:51,000
Marco Collogero, played by Eric Roberts.

4
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:26,000
Sebastian Collogero, played by Giancarlo Giannini.

5
00:37:55,000 --> 00:38:01,000
William Bradford Berrigan, played by Dennis Hopper.

6
00:45:30,000 --> 00:45:36,000
Andrews, played by Burt Young.

7
00:53:05,000 --> 00:53:11,000
Miss Jeffreys, played by Carlin Glynn.

8
01:00:40,000 --> 01:00:46,000
Maria Collogero, played by Julia Roberts.

9
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
Blood Red is a 1989 American Western film directed by Peter Masterson and starring Eric
Roberts, Giancarlo Giannini, Burt Young, Lara Harris and Dennis Hopper.

10
01:15:50,000 --> 01:15:56,000
Although it was filmed and completed in 1986, the film
was released three years later in 1989.

11
01:23:25,000 --> 01:23:31,000
Part of the filming for Blood Red occurred at the Picchetti
Brothers Winery in Cupertino, California.
